{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44767","headline":"句 · 灵澈","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松树有死枝，塚上唯莓苔。\n石门无人入，古木花不开。\n绿竹岁寒在，故人衰老多。\n月色静中见，泉声深处闻。\n古观茅山下，诸峯欲曙时。\n真人是黄子，玉堂生紫芝。\n禅门至六祖，衣鉢无人得。\n古墓碑表折，荒壠松柏稀。\n秋深知气正，家近觉山寒。\n山僧不记重阳日，因见茱萸忆去年。\n今非古狱下，莫向斗边看。\n海月生残夜，江春入暮年。\n窗风枯砚水，山雨慢琴弦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"灵澈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}